WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.934 --> 00:00:09.167
Hi, my name is Hana.

2
00:00:09.168 --> 00:00:12.079
I will be showing you my album.

3
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:18.182
Before I start, however, let me introduce my family members to you.

4
00:00:18.183 --> 00:00:21.389
There are five in my family.

5
00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:23.458
First is me.

6
00:00:23.459 --> 00:00:25.664
I am ten years old.

7
00:00:25.665 --> 00:00:31.582
I go to Toto Elementary School, and I am in grade three.

8
00:00:31.583 --> 00:00:36.566
I love to draw pictures, sing and dance.

9
00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:41.811
I can swim well and would like to learn taekwondo someday.

10
00:00:41.812 --> 00:00:48.903
My favorite food is barbecue chicken, spaghetti and chocolate ice cream.

11
00:00:48.904 --> 00:00:51.481
Second is my dad.

12
00:00:51.482 --> 00:00:55.786
He is forty years old and is really tall.

13
00:00:55.787 --> 00:00:59.780
He loves me the best, then my brothers.

14
00:00:59.781 --> 00:01:03.817
He is kind and often reads books to us.

15
00:01:03.818 --> 00:01:08.459
He loves to hike on the mountains with us on the weekends.

16
00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:10.387
Third is my mom.

17
00:01:10.388 --> 00:01:15.082
She is 35 years old and is a bit short.

18
00:01:15.083 --> 00:01:18.372
But I think my mom is the prettiest.

19
00:01:18.373 --> 00:01:23.482
She is an English teacher and can speak English really well.

20
00:01:23.483 --> 00:01:28.012
Although she is strict, she can be fun to be with.

21
00:01:28.013 --> 00:01:30.715
Next is my brother Bada.

22
00:01:30.716 --> 00:01:34.595
He is seven years old and is in kindergarten.

23
00:01:34.596 --> 00:01:37.983
He is very playful and hot-tempered.

24
00:01:37.984 --> 00:01:41.841
He is never interested in school work or food.

25
00:01:41.842 --> 00:01:45.985
My mom is worried that he doesn't eat enough.

26
00:01:45.986 --> 00:01:49.312
Finally, my baby brother Hada.

27
00:01:49.313 --> 00:01:52.627
He is one and has a double chin.

28
00:01:52.628 --> 00:01:55.190
But he is so cute.

29
00:01:55.191 --> 00:01:59.126
He smiles a lot when I sing and dance for him.

30
00:01:59.127 --> 00:02:03.341
I have two grandmothers and one great grandmother.

31
00:02:03.342 --> 00:02:07.713
My great grandmother is one hundred years old.

32
00:02:07.714 --> 00:02:16.861
She is very old but she knows the names of all my family and greets us when we go visit her.

33
00:02:16.862 --> 00:02:25.319
My grandmother on my father's side is 74 years old and she lives with my great grandmother.

34
00:02:25.320 --> 00:02:30.944
She is very kind and does whatever I ask her.

35
00:02:30.945 --> 00:02:36.942
My grandmother on my mother's side is 73 years old.

36
00:02:36.943 --> 00:02:40.784
She lives in a house and has two dogs.

37
00:02:40.785 --> 00:02:44.053
She loves dogs.

38
00:02:44.054 --> 00:02:49.350
These are my family members, and you will get to see them in my album.

39
00:02:49.351 --> 00:02:53.086
I hope you have fun. See you!
